<p>Ibne janabe Fatima Zehra ne ki qaza,<br>
Wahasrata ke Shabbare waala ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>Haider ka chand raahiy e mulke adam huwa,<br>
Duniya siyah hai ma-e Zehra ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>Afsos ab gharibou ka pursa nahi koi,<br>
Rahat risaane bekas o tanha ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>Jab koi poochta hai sabab aah sard ka,<br>
Rokar Hussain kehte hai bhaiyya ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>Deendaar ro rahe hai arab ke udhaake qaak,<br>
Yasrab ke Shaahe Sarware bat'ha ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>Bachhe tadap rahe hai zamee'n par pade huwe,<br>
Sajjad kehte hai ame waala ne ki qaza.</p>

<p>'Masroor' dost daare Hasan peet te hai sar,<br>
Sar par udhao qaak ke Agha ne ki qaza..</p>